"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101584","id":2593359434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ak4ZK","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T16:16:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T16:16:37Z","body":"Wouldn't it make sense to give signals and groups [their own docks](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/9052#discussioncomment-8429165) so that they can occupy the same tab bar as the inspector tab instead of making another line in already crowded inspector header?\r\n\r\nIt would:\r\n- Unnest them to allow users to customize the UI however they want, which will become even more relevant when godot improves the docking system to allow for more flexibility. Docks allow users with big enough screens to have an option to _not_ switch tabs. With this UI it's not an option, you just _have_ to click a lot.\r\n- Allow them to take advantage of the [icon-only mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91039)\r\n- Allow us to avoid creating a unique style for subtabs\r\n- Keep the possibility for drag-and-drop between props/signals/groups open in case new features are introduced where it's needed\r\n\r\nI understand the motivation to group them together in a single dock as they all operate on selected node(s), but I'm not sure nested tabs are convenient in practice","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593359434/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593376807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101584#issuecomment-2593376807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101584","id":2593376807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ak8on","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T16:23:55Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T16:23:55Z","body":"> Keep the possibility for drag-and-drop between props/signals/groups open in case new features are introduced where it's needed\r\n\r\nThis will still be possible. We can make the tabs switch on hover.\r\n\r\n> Unnest them to allow users to customize the UI however they want, which will become even more relevant when godot improves the docking system to allow for more flexibility. Docks allow users with big enough screens to have an option to not switch tabs. With this UI it's not an option, you just have to click a lot.\r\n\r\nI guess that's an alternative solution (I think there was a proposal about it too). Though only users with big enough screens would benefit from it, in practice seeing all 3 of these tabs at once is rarely useful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593376807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593774831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101584#issuecomment-2593774831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101584","id":2593774831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6amdzv","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://